  "problem": {
    "headline": "Shoppers cannot apply a promo code at checkout.",
    "plain": "The checkout page has no promo code field. The totals come from computeTotals in cart/totals.ts, which knows only items and shipping, and placeOrder in checkout/order.ts charges exactly that total. A code would have to reach the cart total, the order and the payment.",
